  "title": "Bina Mehta",
  "summary": "Ms. Mehta joined EXL’s board in July 2026. From 2021 until 2026, she served as Chair of KPMG UK. She has over 30 years’ experience at KPMG advising global businesses on strategy, M&A, restructuring, transformation and change to deliver sustainable growth. Ms. Mehta has held leadership positions in the UK, US, Canada and India member firms, including leading the Emerging Giants practice focused on fast growth technology businesses.",
